<title>POLAND: BYTOM AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 60.000.</title>
<headline>BYTOM AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 60.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.06 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.25 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.84 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Sales		    6.49 vs   6.42</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.17 vs   1.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.45 vs   3.12</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.85 vs   5.38</p>
<p> Sales		   51.51 vs  46.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
